        'vehicle_2_use_num' incorrectly implies a use percentage.
      model: claude-sonnet-4-6
      contested: 'the publisher''s tooltip / path (''Enter number: The producer assigned
        vehicle number. Vehicle_ProducerIdentifier_B'') and the caption (''VEH'')
        disagree'
    x_petey_review:
      model: claude-opus-5
      changed:
      - description
      reason: Tooltip, publisher name Vehicle_ProducerIdentifier_B and the printed
        VEH caption all say this box holds the producer assigned vehicle number, not
        a use percentage; the current name points at a different column.
      before:
        type: string
        description: The producer assigned vehicle number.
      judged: 'kept: 3 -> 3'
